# Agentic Workstation Optimizer (`agentic-workstation-optimizer`)

When asked to diagnose or optimize workstation hardware, software, gaming performance, network speed, Cloud AI API connectivity, automated testing port limits, WSL2 networking, or local AI (Ollama/GPU):

1. Follow the steps in [SKILL.md](mdc:SKILL.md).
2. Run the read-only diagnostic script first:
   `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ./scripts/diagnose-network-ai.ps1 -SaveReport`
3. Choose the appropriate mode for `./scripts/optimize-workstation.ps1` (which automatically backs up current settings before making changes):
   - `-Mode All` (default): For home PCs (Hardware, Software, Gaming, Network & AI).
   - `-Mode Work`: For company/office PCs (skips gaming tweaks and never alters corporate DNS, Active Directory, or VPN profiles).
   - `-Mode Gaming`: Dedicated to gaming performance and low latency.
